      "side": 1,
      "message": "I intentionally didn\u0027t change this one:\n- GetActivePageObjectCount() is O(n) to get the count, whereas GetPageObjectCount() is O(1)\n- This method isn\u0027t interested in an exact count anyway; it only wants to know if it is exactly 1 or not.\n\nSo all the work for getting the particular number of objects is overkill.  It is cheaper to use GetPageObjectCount() as before, plus a local explicit check for IsActive() instead.\n\nAdded a comment to that regard.",
